# Keep the repository byte-stable across platforms.
#
# Everything this repo ships is text (TypeScript, JSON, YAML, Markdown) and
# `scripts/verify/` compares derived bytes and hashes, so a Windows checkout must
# not rewrite LF into CRLF. Contributors on Windows: do not disable this.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The lockfile is compared by npm; never let a checkout rewrite its line endings.
package-lock.json -text

# Imported test fixtures, if any are ever checked in, must stay byte-identical.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
